art-2 sm:ml-[2px] sm:min-w-0 sm:p-[2px]"><div class="sm:min-h-full sm:bg-pure-black"><!--[-1--><!--[--><div class="relative isolate flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-hidden px-3"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 -z-20 max-h-[640px] w-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/images/heroBg.webp" alt="Background pixel art cave illustration" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="w-full"/> <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-pure-black to-pure-black/0 h-40 sm:h-64"></div></div> <div class="absolute top-10 hidden w-full max-w-5xl flex-row items-center justify-end gap-8 sm:flex 2xl:max-w-7xl"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><!--]--> <a href="https://discord.gg/vs4MFrzncH" class="flex flex-row justify-center items-center gap-2"><img src="/icons/discordIcon.svg" alt="Discord icon" height="20" width="20"/> <span>Join</span></a></div><!----> <section class="mt-36 flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center sm:mt-28 2xl:mt-40"><div class="flex w-full max-w-2xl flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center sm:gap-8"><h1 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Open Source Pixel Art VFX</h1> <p class="text-base sm:text-xl">25 free, open source pixel art effects. Connect your AI agent to the library: it builds them into
				your game, or creates new ones from them.</p> <div class="flex w-full justify-center sm:max-w-xs"><!--[-1--><button class="font-chevyrayOeuf  relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button w-full opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!---->  <dialog aria-label="Connect your AI agent" class="m-auto max-h-[calc(100dvh-24px)] w-[calc(100%-24px)] max-w-xl overflow-y-auto border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-white backdrop:bg-pure-black backdrop:opacity-90"><div class="shadow-window-body bg-black font-chevyray flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-0 w-full "><div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full items-center py-[6px] px-2 shadow-window-head bg-medium-gray"><!--[-1--><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!--]--> <!--[0--><button><img src="/icons/closeIcon.svg" alt="Close icon" width="20" height="20"/></button><!--]--></div> <div class="p-[6px] flex min-h-0 grow flex-col justify-center items-center w-full"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 p-2 text-left sm:p-4"><p>Your AI agent reads all 25 effects, builds them into your game, and creates new ones from them.</p> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Claude Code</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">claude mcp add --transport http spritefusion https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Codex</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp add spritefusion --url https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp login spritefusion<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Then ask</h3> <div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><p class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input ">Look at Sprite Fusion's pixel art VFX and add the effects my game is missing.<!----></p><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!----></div> <p class="text-sm">Claude, Cursor, VS Code, ChatGPT or another agent? <a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/api/mcp" class="underline hover:text-white">See the MCP docs</a>.</p></div><!----></div></div><!----></dialog><!----></div></div></section> <div class="mt-16 w-full max-w-5xl sm:mt-24"><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:w-fit sm:grid-cols-6"><!--[--><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="true" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-medium-gray"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->All VFX<!----></div></button><!----></a><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Combat" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="false" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-black"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->Combat<!----></div></button><!----></a><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Elements" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="false" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-black"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->Elements<!----></div></button><!----></a><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Magic" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="false" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-black"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->Magic<!----></div></button><!----></a><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Feedback" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="false" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-black"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->Feedback<!----></div></button><!----></a><a data-sveltekit-replacestate="" data-sveltekit-keepfocus="" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Environment" class="contents"><button aria-pressed="false" class="px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input flex flex-row justify-center items-center space-x-[6px] hover:bg-medium-gray text-sm bg-black"><div class="mt-[3px]"><!---->Environment<!----></div></button><!----></a><!--]--></div></div> <!--[--><section class="flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 mt-12 sm:mt-16"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Combat</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/explosion" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/explosion-dirt.webp" alt="Explosion pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Explosion</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A blast that tears up the ground: fireball, earth, chunks, shockwave.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/impact" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/impact-hits-and-ricochets.webp" alt="Impact pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Impact</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Bullet hits and ricochets: sparks, shards, chips and dust.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/slash" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/slash-slash.webp" alt="Slash pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Slash</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A blade's cut drawn as light, from white-hot edge to fading tail.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/muzzle-flash" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/muzzle-flash-smg-burst.webp" alt="Muzzle Flash pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Muzzle Flash</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Gun flashes with hot sparks, barrel smoke and tumbling casings.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/blood" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/blood-hit.webp" alt="Blood pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Blood</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A hit's spray: strands, mist, droplets and drying stains.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/movement" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/movement-dash.webp" alt="Dash &amp; Blink pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="eager" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Dash &amp; Blink</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Dashes with afterimages, and blinks that come apart in light.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><!--]--></div></section><section class="flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 mt-16 sm:mt-20"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Elements</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/fire" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/fire-on-fire.webp" alt="Fire pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Fire</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Anything on fire: flames licking up its own outline.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/lightning" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/lightning-strike-from-the-sky.webp" alt="Lightning pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Lightning</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Forked bolts from the sky, chain arcs and electrified characters.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/ice" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/ice-nova.webp" alt="Ice pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Ice</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Spikes, a frost nova, crystals, shattering blocks, frozen characters.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/poison" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/poison-gas-cloud.webp" alt="Poison pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Poison</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Toxic clouds, bubbling puddles and poisoned characters.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><!--]--></div></section><section class="flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 mt-16 sm:mt-20"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Magic</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/energy" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/energy-plasma-orb.webp" alt="Energy pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Energy</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Charged orbs, beams, plasma orbs and bolts.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/shield" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/shield-hex-dome.webp" alt="Shield pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Shield</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A hex-cell dome that forms, takes hits and breaks.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/black-hole" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/black-hole-black-hole.webp" alt="Black Hole pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Black Hole</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A black hole with a lensed disk that eats everything around it.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/holy-light" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/holy-light-pillar.webp" alt="Holy Light pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Holy Light</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A golden pillar slamming down from the sky, or a quick smite.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><!--]--></div></section><section class="flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 mt-16 sm:mt-20"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Feedback</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/heal" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/heal-heal.webp" alt="Heal &amp; Mana pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Heal &amp; Mana</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Healing crosses, or mana drops, rising round the character.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/power-up" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/power-up-speed.webp" alt="Power Up pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Power Up</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A buff aura gripping the character's own outline.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/pickup" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/pickup-gem-coin-orb.webp" alt="Pickup pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Pickup</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Gems, coins and orbs, pulled in or popped, sparkles homing in.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/sparkle" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/sparkle-glint.webp" alt="Sparkle pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Sparkle</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Four-point glints twinkling on anything shiny.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><!--]--></div></section><section class="flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 mt-16 sm:mt-20"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Environment</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/rain" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/rain-rain.webp" alt="Rain pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Rain</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Slanted rain with splashes, ripples and mist.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/snow" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/snow-snowfall.webp" alt="Snow pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Snow</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Snowfall on a shifting breeze, settling into a drift.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/fog" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/fog-night-fog.webp" alt="Fog pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Fog</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Drifting ground fog that passes in front of characters.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/embers" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/embers-embers.webp" alt="Embers pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Embers</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Embers, cinders and ash rising off a fire below.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/fireflies" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/fireflies-fireflies.webp" alt="Fireflies pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Fireflies</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Fireflies drifting and blinking over swaying grass.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/falling-leaves" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/falling-leaves-autumn.webp" alt="Falling Leaves pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Falling Leaves</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Leaves swinging down onto a litter on the ground.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/bubbles" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/bubbles-underwater.webp" alt="Bubbles pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Bubbles</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Underwater bubbles rising from vents to a shimmering surface.</p> <span class="mt-auto flex items-center text-sm"><span class="underline underline-offset-[0.2em]">View</span> <img src="/icons/chevronRightIcon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="-ml-1"/></span></div></a><!--]--></div></section><!--]--> <section class="mt-24 flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-10 sm:mt-32"><h2 class="text-center font-chevyrayOeuf text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Ask your AI agent for any effect</h2> <div class="w-full max-w-3xl"><div class="shadow-window-body bg-black font-chevyray flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-0 w-full "><div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full items-center py-[6px] px-2 shadow-window-head bg-medium-gray"><!--[-1--><p>Claude/Codex</p><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class="p-[2px] flex min-h-0 grow flex-col justify-center items-center w-full"><div class="w-full p-3 text-left"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 bg-pure-black p-4 leading-[1.8] shadow-input sm:p-5"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2"><p class="text-sm text-light-gray">You</p> <p>Add snowfall to my winter levels.</p></div> <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-sm text-light-gray">Claude</p> <p>I found the snow effect in Sprite Fusion's VFX library and built it into your winter levels.</p> <img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/snow-snowfall.webp" alt="Snow pixel art effect: snowfall playing in a game" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full max-w-[320px] shadow-input"/></div></div></div><!----></div></div><!----></div> <p class="max-w-2xl text-center leading-relaxed">Want something new? Your agent builds it from the closest effects, like an acid rain from the rain and poison.</p> <div class="flex w-full justify-center sm:max-w-xs"><!--[-1--><button class="font-chevyrayOeuf  relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button w-full opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!---->  <dialog aria-label="Connect your AI agent" class="m-auto max-h-[calc(100dvh-24px)] w-[calc(100%-24px)] max-w-xl overflow-y-auto border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-white backdrop:bg-pure-black backdrop:opacity-90"><div class="shadow-window-body bg-black font-chevyray flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-0 w-full "><div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full items-center py-[6px] px-2 shadow-window-head bg-medium-gray"><!--[-1--><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!--]--> <!--[0--><button><img src="/icons/closeIcon.svg" alt="Close icon" width="20" height="20"/></button><!--]--></div> <div class="p-[6px] flex min-h-0 grow flex-col justify-center items-center w-full"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 p-2 text-left sm:p-4"><p>Your AI agent reads all 25 effects, builds them into your game, and creates new ones from them.</p> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Claude Code</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">claude mcp add --transport http spritefusion https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Codex</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp add spritefusion --url https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp login spritefusion<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Then ask</h3> <div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><p class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input ">Look at Sprite Fusion's pixel art VFX and add the effects my game is missing.<!----></p><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!----></div> <p class="text-sm">Claude, Cursor, VS Code, ChatGPT or another agent? <a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/api/mcp" class="underline hover:text-white">See the MCP docs</a>.</p></div><!----></div></div><!----></dialog><!----></div></section> <section id="faq" class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center mt-32 sm:mt-48 w-full max-w-7xl"><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center space-y-10 max-w-2xl"><div class="sm:space-y-8 space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center"><h2 class="sm:text-5xl text-4xl font-chevyrayOeuf text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2> <p class="text-center">Check the <a href="/docs" class="underline">docs</a> or ask on our <a data-pirsch-event="Click Discord (FAQ)" href="https://discord.gg/vs4MFrzncH" style="text-decoration-line: underline;">Discord server</a>!</p></div></div> <div class="w-full max-w-4xl flex flex-col space-y-10 mt-20"><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">What are pixel art VFX?</p> <p><!---->VFX, or visual effects, are the explosions, hits, spells, fire and weather that make a game feel alive. Pixel art VFX are drawn on the same pixel grid as your sprites, with limited palettes and dithering instead of blur, so they fit a pixel art game instead of looking pasted on.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">Which pixel art effects are included?</p> <p><!---->25 effects so far: explosion, bullet impacts and ricochets, slash, muzzle flash, blood, dash and blink, fire, lightning, ice, poison, energy orbs and beams, shield, black hole, holy light, heal and mana, power-up, pickups, sparkle, rain, snow, fog, embers, fireflies, falling leaves and bubbles. The library is actively updated, with new effects added all the time.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">Are these pixel art effects free for commercial use?</p> <p><!---->Yes. They're open source under the MIT license: use them in free and commercial games, and change them as much as you want.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">How is this different from a pixel art effects pack?</p> <p><!---->An effects pack gives you sprite sheets: fixed frames at one size, in one palette. Here each effect is source code that draws its pixels and particles while your game runs, so options like size, colors and timing change it. The same file makes a small blast or a big one, and your AI agent can tune it to your game.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">Can I get them as sprite sheets?</p> <p><!---->They come as code, not images. If your engine needs a sprite sheet, ask your AI agent to play the effect and save its frames as one.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">Do they work in Unity, Godot or GameMaker?</p> <p><!---->Each effect is one TypeScript file with no dependencies: it works in any JavaScript or TypeScript game, drawn on a canvas or a texture. For Unity, Godot, GameMaker or another engine, your AI agent ports the file to its language, or rebuilds the effect from its recipe.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">How do I use them with Claude, Codex or another AI agent?</p> <p><!---->Connect the Sprite Fusion MCP server, then ask for what your game needs, like snowfall on your mountain levels. Your agent finds the right effect, reads its recipe and source code, and implements it in your game. You can also download an effect's ZIP and give the file to your agent. See the <a href='/docs/pixel-art-generator/api/mcp' class='underline'>MCP docs</a>.<!----></p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-start space-y-2"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-xl">Can I make new effects from these?</p> <p><!---->Yes, they're made for it. Ask your AI agent to start from the closest effect, like a fireball from the energy bolt or acid rain from the rain. Each effect's recipe tells it which timings, layers and colors make it look right.<!----></p></div><!--]--></div></section><!----> <footer class="w-full text-light-gray mt-32 sm:mt-64 mb-8" aria-label="Sprite Fusion footer"><div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:p-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(240px,320px)_1fr] lg:gap-16"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6"><a href="/" class="flex"><img src="/images/logoWhite.svg" alt="Sprite Fusion" height="24"/></a> <div class="flex max-w-sm flex-col gap-3 text-sm"><p>Pixel art tools for making 2D games: generate sprites, clean pixel art, and build tilemaps.</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <p>Made by Hugo Duprez.</p></div> <div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3"><a href="https://discord.gg/vs4MFrzncH" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2 bg-medium-gray px-2 py-[6px] text-white shadow-button hover:bg-light-gray"><img src="/icons/discordIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <span class="mt-1">Join</span></a></div></div> <nav class="grid w-full grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-5" aria-label="Footer navigation"><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-chevyray text-base text-white">Pixel Art Tools</p> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><!--[--><!--[-1--><a href="/" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Tilemap Editor</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-art-generator" class="text-sm hover:text-white">AI Pixel Art Generator</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-art-animator" class="text-sm hover:text-white">AI Pixel Art Animator</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/ai-pixel-art-editor" class="text-sm hover:text-white">AI Pixel Art Editor</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-snapper" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Pixel Snapper</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/sprite-normals" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Normal map generator</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-chevyray text-base text-white">Resources</p> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><!--[--><!--[-1--><a href="/blog" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Blog</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/tilesets" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Free tilesets</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Free pixel art effects</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-snapper/how-to-fix-ai-pixel-art" class="text-sm hover:text-white">How to fix AI pixel art</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/pixel-art-color-palettes" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Pixel art color palettes</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-chevyray text-base text-white">Guides</p> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><!--[--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/api" class="text-sm hover:text-white">API</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/quick-start" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Pixel Art Generator docs</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/edit-your-pixel-art" class="text-sm hover:text-white">How to edit pixel art with AI</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/generate-8-directions-for-your-pixel-art" class="text-sm hover:text-white">How to generate 8-direction sprites</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/generate-pixel-art-with-style-consistency" class="text-sm hover:text-white">How to generate pixel art in the same style</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/generate-normal-maps" class="text-sm hover:text-white">How to generate normal maps</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/tilemap-editor/quick-start" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Tilemap Editor docs</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/docs/pixel-snapper/overview" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Pixel Snapper docs</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-chevyray text-base text-white">Community</p> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><!--[--><!--[-1--><a href="https://discord.gg/vs4MFrzncH" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Discord</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="https://github.com/Hugo-Dz/spritefusion-pixel-snapper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm hover:text-white">GitHub</a><!--]--><!--[0--><a href="#" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Contact</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-chevyray text-base text-white">Legal</p> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><!--[--><!--[-1--><a href="/terms" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Terms</a><!--]--><!--[-1--><a href="/privacy" class="text-sm hover:text-white">Privacy</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></nav> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-medium-gray pt-4 text-sm lg:col-span-2"><p>Copyright 2026 Sprite Fusion. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></footer><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></main> <div class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-0 right-0 top-0 z-30 hidden shadow-button sm:left-[282px] sm:block"></div></div><!--]--> <div class="toaster  svelte-haq5xk" role="alert"><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]-->
			
			<script>
				{
					__sveltekit_1fe1etb = {
						base: new URL(".", location).pathname.slice(0, -1),
						env: {"PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY":"sb_publishable_pxS8aftCCuiYZlmtc12MyQ_THCQ0Mz7","PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL":"https://czacsbngcrjijlchhsml.supabase.co"}
					};

					const element = document.currentScript.parentElement;

					Promise.all([
						import("./_app/immutable/entry/start.MK_iRL-F.js"),
						import("./_app/immutable/entry/app.D9bmjtew.js")
					]).then(([kit, app]) => {
						kit.start(app, element, {
							node_ids: [0, 51],
							data: [{type:"data",data:{cookies:[],session:null,user:null,userProfile:{id:null,email:null,createdAt:null,subscription:"none",credits:0,disableRewardSubmission:false}},uses:{search_params:["utm_source"]}},{type:"data",data:{effects:[{slug:"explosion",title:"Explosion",category:"Combat",tagline:"A blast that tears up the ground: fireball, earth, chunks, shockwave.",about:"A blast out of the ground: a white-hot flash, a fireball cooling into smoke, earth and chunks thrown in arcs, dust rolling out, a shockwave and a scorch left behind. Size it from a grenade to a bomb.",situations:[{name:"Blast",file:"dirt"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's explosion effect for my grenades: blow up where they land, with dirt in my ground's colour.",uses:"Then have it size the blast to each weapon, match the dirt to your ground, or turn the fire and chunks down for a dust burst.",call:"explosion({ x: 320, y: 300 })"},{slug:"impact",title:"Impact",category:"Combat",tagline:"Bullet hits and ricochets: sparks, shards, chips and dust.",about:"A bullet's hit: a star stretched along the bounce breaking into shards, a ring, hot sparks, chips and dust in the surface's colour. Glancing shots ricochet in a hot streak. One call per shot.",situations:[{name:"Hits",file:"hits-and-ricochets"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's impact effect for my bullets hitting the floor and walls, with a ricochet when the angle is shallow.",uses:"Then have it match the chips to each surface, pick a hit or a ricochet by angle, or recolour the sparks for energy weapons.",call:"impact({ kind: \"hit\", x: 320, y: 300, angle: -0.5, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"slash",isNew:true,title:"Slash",category:"Combat",tagline:"A blade's cut drawn as light, from white-hot edge to fading tail.",about:"A blade's cut as light: a crescent smeared out in a few frames, its white-hot edge, an echo inside it, its tail sliding after its head and dissolving into a thread. Chain calls for combos.",situations:[{name:"Combo",file:"slash"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's slash effect to give my player a melee combo: two quick cuts, the second tilted the other way.",uses:"Then have it fit the arc to your weapon's reach, chain the cuts into longer combos, or recolour the blade for each element.",call:"slash({ x: 320, y: 240 })"},{slug:"muzzle-flash",title:"Muzzle Flash",category:"Combat",tagline:"Gun flashes with hot sparks, barrel smoke and tumbling casings.",about:"A shot's star and jet with a white-hot core and a dark rim, hot sparks, smoke curling off the barrel, and a casing tumbling out to lie on the ground. One call per shot.",situations:[{name:"Burst",file:"smg-burst"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's muzzle flash effect on my SMG: a flash at the barrel on every shot, casings flying out.",uses:"Then have it scale the flash for each gun, drop the casings for energy weapons, or turn the smoke off for rapid fire.",call:"muzzleFlash({ x: 320, y: 240, angle: 0, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"blood",title:"Blood",category:"Combat",tagline:"A hit's spray: strands, mist, droplets and drying stains.",about:"A spray that flies on along the hit: strands, mist, droplets splatting into stains that dry darker, and drops beading at the wound. Recolour it for any creature.",situations:[{name:"Hit",file:"hit"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's blood effect for when my player gets shot, spraying along the bullet's direction.",uses:"Then have it aim the spray along each hit, recolour it for robots or slimes, or keep the stains on the ground longer.",call:"blood({ x: 320, y: 240, angle: 0, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"movement",isNew:true,title:"Dash & Blink",category:"Combat",tagline:"Dashes with afterimages, and blinks that come apart in light.",about:"A dash leaving afterimages shaded from the character's own pixels and a skid of dust, or a blink that pulls the character apart in light and streams it back in somewhere else. It moves your character through cues.",situations:[{name:"Dash",file:"dash"},{name:"Blink",file:"blink"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's dash and blink effect for my player's dash: afterimages trailing their sprite.",uses:"Then have it fit the dash to your character's speed and distance, recolour the afterimages, or turn it into a teleport.",call:"movement({ kind: \"dash\", actor: player })"},{slug:"fire",title:"Fire",category:"Elements",tagline:"Anything on fire: flames licking up its own outline.",about:"A character, or anything, on fire: flames licking up its own outline, trailing behind as it moves, embers, smoke and a flickering glow.",situations:[{name:"Burning",file:"on-fire"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's fire effect to set my player on fire for 3 seconds, the flames trailing behind as they run.",uses:"Then have it set any sprite or object on fire, choose how long it burns, or recolour the flames for magic fire.",call:"fire({ actor: player })"},{slug:"lightning",title:"Lightning",category:"Elements",tagline:"Forked bolts from the sky, chain arcs and electrified characters.",about:"Jagged forked bolts outlined against their own glare: a strike from the sky with its storm, an electric hit, chain lightning hopping between targets, a character crackling with arcs.",situations:[{name:"Strike",file:"strike-from-the-sky"},{name:"Impact",file:"electric-impact"},{name:"Chain",file:"chain-arc"},{name:"Electrified",file:"electrified"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's lightning effect for my storm attack: a bolt striking from the sky, lighting up the screen.",uses:"Then have it strike where your spells land, chain between enemies, or recolour the bolts for each element.",call:"lightning({ kind: \"strike\", x: 320, ground: 300, top: -30 })"},{slug:"ice",title:"Ice",category:"Elements",tagline:"Spikes, a frost nova, crystals, shattering blocks, frozen characters.",about:"Faceted ice for every case: spikes erupting along the ground, a frost nova that crusts the floor and snaps crystal clusters up, a shimmering cluster, a block shattering, and a character frozen solid that cracks free.",situations:[{name:"Nova",file:"nova"},{name:"Spikes",file:"spikes"},{name:"Crystals",file:"crystals"},{name:"Shatter",file:"shatter"},{name:"Freeze",file:"freeze"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's ice effect for my mage's ultimate: a frost nova freezing the ground around them.",uses:"Then have it set the nova's reach, line spikes up along your floor, or freeze and shatter enemies when they're hit.",call:"ice({ kind: \"nova\", x: 320, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"poison",title:"Poison",category:"Elements",tagline:"Toxic clouds, bubbling puddles and poisoned characters.",about:"Toxic gas drawn the way smoke is, in sickly greens: a thrown flask's cloud, a bubbling, fuming puddle, and a poisoned character with a pulse running up its pixels, drips and fumes.",situations:[{name:"Cloud",file:"gas-cloud"},{name:"Puddle",file:"toxic-puddle"},{name:"Poisoned",file:"poisoned"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's poison effect for my poison flask: a gas cloud lingering where it lands.",uses:"Then have it drop clouds where your flasks land, leave puddles on your floors, or recolour the gas for acid or curses.",call:"poison({ kind: \"cloud\", x: 320, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"energy",title:"Energy",category:"Magic",tagline:"Charged orbs, beams, plasma orbs and bolts.",about:"Raw energy in one recolourable ramp: an orb charged at a hand and released, a sustained beam, a floating plasma orb with filaments and ground zaps, and bolts with tapering trails.",situations:[{name:"Orb",file:"plasma-orb"},{name:"Charge",file:"charge"},{name:"Beam",file:"beam"},{name:"Bolts",file:"bolts"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's energy effect for my wizard's plasma orb: it floats where I cast it, zapping the ground below.",uses:"Then have it time the charge to your fire button, set the beam's width, or recolour the orb for each spell.",call:"energy({ kind: \"orb\", x: 320, y: 200 })"},{slug:"shield",isNew:true,title:"Shield",category:"Magic",tagline:"A hex-cell dome that forms, takes hits and breaks.",about:"A true hemisphere of hex cells forming cell by cell over the character. Rounds spark off it and ripple through it before it breaks up into shards.",situations:[{name:"Dome",file:"hex-dome"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's shield effect to give my player a dome shield for 3 seconds, sparking where bullets hit it.",uses:"Then have it size the dome to your character, hold it as long as the ability lasts, or recolour it for each team.",call:"shield({ x: 320, y: 300 })"},{slug:"black-hole",title:"Black Hole",category:"Magic",tagline:"A black hole with a lensed disk that eats everything around it.",about:"A black hole with a lensed accretion disk, a photon ring and Doppler beaming. It pulls in what's around it, fires jets on big meals, then implodes and bursts. It can also bend your scene's pixels around it.",situations:[{name:"Singularity",file:"black-hole"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's black hole effect for my gravity spell: tearing up the floor and bending the screen around it.",uses:"Then have it size the singularity, set how long it pulls, or match the torn-up floor to your ground.",call:"blackHole({ x: 320, y: 200, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"holy-light",title:"Holy Light",category:"Magic",tagline:"A golden pillar slamming down from the sky, or a quick smite.",about:"A gold column slamming down from the sky with a white core, shimmering fibres and halos, a ring along the ground and sparkles rising, narrowing to a thread. Or a short, narrow smite.",situations:[{name:"Pillar",file:"pillar"},{name:"Smite",file:"smite"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's holy light effect for my cleric's ultimate: a pillar of light slamming down where I aim.",uses:"Then have it widen the pillar for ultimates, shorten it into a smite, or recolour it for dark magic.",call:"holyLight({ x: 320, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"heal",title:"Heal & Mana",category:"Feedback",tagline:"Healing crosses, or mana drops, rising round the character.",about:"Light spreading along the floor and bands of light climbing the character, with outlined pixel crosses rising and glinting for health, or elixir drops, bubbles and spiralling strands for mana.",situations:[{name:"Heal",file:"heal"},{name:"Mana",file:"mana-refill"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's heal effect for when my player drinks a health potion.",uses:"Then have it play on potions and regen, switch to mana for refills, or recolour it for shields or stamina.",call:"heal({ kind: \"mana\", x: 320, y: 300 })"},{slug:"power-up",isNew:true,title:"Power Up",category:"Feedback",tagline:"A buff aura gripping the character's own outline.",about:"A buff in its stat's colour: streaks drawn in, the character flashing, a shock racing along the floor, then an aura gripping the character's own outline and licking upward, with speed streaks and motes.",situations:[{name:"Speed",file:"speed"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's power-up effect for my speed boost pickup: a cyan aura around my player.",uses:"Then have it recolour the aura for each stat, scale it with the buff's strength, or play it on every pickup.",call:"powerUp({ actor: player })"},{slug:"pickup",title:"Pickup",category:"Feedback",tagline:"Gems, coins and orbs, pulled in or popped, sparkles homing in.",about:"Items hovering and glinting, their shadows breathing, then pulled into the character along an arc or popped in place, their sparkles curving into it. A gem, a coin, an orb or your own sprite: keep the ones your game needs.",situations:[{name:"Collect",file:"gem-coin-orb"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's pickup effect for my gems and coins: hovering in place, flying into the player when they get close.",uses:"Then have it recolour gems by rarity, let items pop in place instead of flying in, or use your own item sprites.",call:"pickup({ item: \"coin\", x: 320, y: 260, actor: player, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"sparkle",title:"Sparkle",category:"Feedback",tagline:"Four-point glints twinkling on anything shiny.",about:"Four-point flares twinkling: a big glint turning and pulsing among small ones, or small glints catching here and there. For treasure, secrets and anything shiny.",situations:[{name:"Glint",file:"glint"},{name:"Twinkle",file:"small-glints"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's sparkle effect to put glints on the hidden secrets in my levels, so players notice them.",uses:"Then have it mark your secrets and loot, size the glint to each item, or warm its colours for gold.",call:"sparkle({ x: 320, y: 200 })"},{slug:"rain",title:"Rain",category:"Environment",tagline:"Slanted rain with splashes, ripples and mist.",about:"Slanted rain in three depths, crowns of droplets and rings on the wet ground, a mist along the floor. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Rain",file:"rain"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's rain effect to add rain to my city levels at night.",uses:"Then have it thicken the rain for storms, slant it with the wind, or keep it to your outdoor areas.",call:"rain({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 }, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"snow",title:"Snow",category:"Environment",tagline:"Snowfall on a shifting breeze, settling into a drift.",about:"Three depths of snow on a shifting breeze, a drift building along the ground, flakes landing and melting. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Snowfall",file:"snowfall"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's snow effect to add snowfall to my winter levels.",uses:"Then have it turn the snowfall into a blizzard, push it with the wind, or let it settle on your terrain.",call:"snow({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 }, ground: 300 })"},{slug:"fog",title:"Fog",category:"Environment",tagline:"Drifting ground fog that passes in front of characters.",about:"Ground fog in dithered tones: banks at different depths drifting, the nearest passing in front of characters, their wispy tops breathing. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Night",file:"night-fog"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's fog effect to add a low fog drifting over the ground in my night levels.",uses:"Then have it thicken the fog, recolour it for swamps or smoke, or layer it in front of and behind your characters.",call:"fog({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 } })"},{slug:"embers",title:"Embers",category:"Environment",tagline:"Embers, cinders and ash rising off a fire below.",about:"Embers, cinders and ash rising off a fire below, with a warm glow breathing on the ground. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Embers",file:"embers"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's embers effect to add embers rising in my burning city level.",uses:"Then have it fill the air near your lava and fires, keep the embers to an area, or turn the heat glow off.",call:"embers({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 } })"},{slug:"fireflies",title:"Fireflies",category:"Environment",tagline:"Fireflies drifting and blinking over swaying grass.",about:"Grass swaying, fireflies drifting and blinking, a few close ones lighting up the scene. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Fireflies",file:"fireflies"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's fireflies effect to add fireflies to my night levels.",uses:"Then have it fill your night levels, set how many fly close to the camera, or drop the grass if your tiles have some.",call:"fireflies({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 } })"},{slug:"falling-leaves",title:"Falling Leaves",category:"Environment",tagline:"Leaves swinging down onto a litter on the ground.",about:"Leaves of several shapes falling like pendulums onto a litter on the ground, in autumn colours or your own. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Autumn",file:"autumn"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's falling leaves effect to add falling leaves to my autumn levels.",uses:"Then have it recolour the leaves for each season, slow their drift, or let them pile up on your ground.",call:"fallingLeaves({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 } })"},{slug:"bubbles",isNew:true,title:"Bubbles",category:"Environment",tagline:"Underwater bubbles rising from vents to a shimmering surface.",about:"Underwater: bubbles wobbling and growing as they rise from vents, merging and popping at a shimmering surface, specks drifting, caustic light dancing on the floor. A loop filling any area.",situations:[{name:"Underwater",file:"underwater"}],prompt:"Use Sprite Fusion's bubbles effect to add bubbles rising from vents in my underwater level.",uses:"Then have it put vents on your seabed, set where the water's surface is, or tint the water for caves and swamps.",call:"bubbles({ area: { x: 0, y: 0, w: 640, h: 360 } })"}],metatags:{title:"Open Source Pixel Art VFX for your game - Sprite Fusion",description:"25 free pixel art effects for your game: explosions, ice, lightning, fire, shields, pickups, rain and more. Open source, ready for your AI agent.",ogImage:"https://www.spritefusion.com/images/pixel-art-vfx/ice.webp"}},uses:{}}],
							form: null,
							error: null
						});
					});
				}
			</script>
		</div>
</body>

</html>